{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:690","content":{"id":690,"title":"复原 IP 地址","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c1c1c78a-a16d-4269-9356-6d4e1618f92e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d7c74356-a4e2-41fb-9c0a-29886104eb1d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个只包含数字的字符串 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"s"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，用以表示一个 IP 地址，返回所有可能从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"s"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获得的 有效 IP 地址 。你可以按任何顺序返回答案。有效 IP 地址正好由四个整数(每个整数位于 0 到 255 之间组成，且不能含有前导 0)，整数之间用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"."},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分隔。例如："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"0.1.2.201\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"192.168.1.1\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是有效 IP 地址，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"0.011.255.245\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"192.168.1.312\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"192.168@1.1\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是无效 IP 地址。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1f9cdad8-1ac2-4e78-91b0-eab0814b0721","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"04af1bc4-ca8f-4450-bd7d-b2e54c929e44","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"83a5af69-48ce-4ad8-8609-8a1d546bccaf","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：s = \"25525511135\"\n输出：[\"255.255.11.135\",\"255.255.111.35\"]","collabId":"45cb7c50-24a2-4fd9-8517-76e69b8354c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0379b0c7-acb9-4201-b147-303351bbebd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"5256778f-1d25-4339-b5fd-845d0e2c3b4d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4dbce69c-c62a-4845-bdfd-66563dcc3ea5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：s = \"0000\"\n输出：[\"0.0.0.0\"]","collabId":"d3a463fb-e8cd-4312-978d-45f23662e548","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"8ed5bb91-b4b9-4392-8bf6-eff36a6c84e2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cc6be4a2-6a5c-4bdc-8105-94b80d0c6f86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义辅助函数，递归调用辅助函数解决问题。辅助函数接收未处理的字符串以及部分 ip 分组，例如对于一个字符串 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"25525511135\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么传入该辅助函数的参数可能为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(\"11135\", [255, 255])"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当字符串处理完毕时结束递归调用，或者 ip 分组中元素个数大于 4 也可停止递归调用。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"b6a1a428-d136-4b3a-886b-f51476c780e9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"45ca8fcf-eb94-46b7-b7f0-c9dbf90b77df","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"List<String> results = new ArrayList<>();\npublic List<String> restoreIpAddresses(String s) {\n    // 长度不够，直接返回\n    if (s.length() < 4) {\n        return results;\n    }\n    restoreIpAddresses(s, new ArrayList<>());\n    return results;\n}\n/**\n *\n * @param leftString 剩余未处理的字符串\n * @param ip 保存ip地址的各个部分，如 [1, 1, 1] [255, 255, 1, 3]\n */\nprivate void restoreIpAddresses(String leftString, List<String> ip) {\n    // ip 超过四个部分，无效\n    if (ip.size() > 4) {\n        return;\n    }\n    // 长度不够或者超出，无效\n    int leftL = leftString.length();\n    if (leftL < (4 - ip.size()) || leftL > (4 - ip.size()) * 3) {\n        return;\n    }\n    // 字符串处理完毕，并且ip中正好有四个部分，取出ip中的元素拼接\n    if (ip.size() == 4 && leftL == 0) {\n        StringBuilder stringBuilder = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < ip.size(); i++) {\n            stringBuilder.append(ip.get(i));\n            if (i != ip.size() - 1) {\n                stringBuilder.append((\".\"));\n            }\n        }\n        results.add(stringBuilder.toString());\n        return;\n    }\n    // 有未处理的字符串，递归调用\n    // 为了防止 subString 调用异常，需要判断剩余未处理字符串与 3 的大小\n    // 这个 3 表示 ip 中每个部分最大的长度\n    for (int i = 1; i <= Math.min(3, leftL); i++) {\n        String str = leftString.substring(0, i);\n        // 如果取出的字符串是无效的，则后面的也是无效的，直接退出循环\n        if (!isValidIp(str)) {\n            break;\n        }\n        ip.add(str);\n        restoreIpAddresses(leftString.substring(i), ip);\n        ip.remove(ip.size() - 1);\n    }\n}\n/**\n * 判断输入的字符串是否为有效的ip组成部分\n * @param s 字符串，如 255 18 7777\n * @return 布尔值，是否是有效ip组成\n */\nprivate boolean isValidIp(String s) {\n    // 长度不对，肯定不是\n    int l = s.length();\n    if (l < 1 || l > 3) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    // 大小范围不对，肯定不是，如 278\n    int n = Integer.parseInt(s);\n    if (n < 0 || n > 255) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    // 有前置的0，也不是，如 09, 024, 007\n    if (l == 2 && n <= 9) {\n        return false;\n    } else if (l == 3 && n <= 99) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    return true;\n}","collabId":"541b98b4-e458-4835-919e-78d37fbfc71f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"71529faa-b532-451d-8dc7-bdbca5644a6d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"35baf6c0-926a-4ca5-bac0-eb1e31285653","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"101586a9-9794-442b-944a-730b8621d63f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"04f1eefc-b708-45b3-89b9-0ba29badb58a","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/restore-ip-addresses/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"03f10337-91cb-4e0b-a431-e16224e09031","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"复原IP地址"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"深度优先遍历"},{"label":"复原 IP 地址","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:690","type":"doc","id":690}}],"prevPage":{"title":"单词搜索","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:688","type":"doc","id":688}},"nextPage":{"title":"全排列","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:698","type":"doc","id":698}},"createTime":1728999589087,"updateTime":1744296772172,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296772172}}